<title>USA: Davel Communications completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Davel Communications completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davel Communications Group Inc said Wednesday it has completed the previously announced acquisition of Blair Telephone Co for $3.9 million in cash.</p>
<p>The acquisition of Blair includes approximately 1,250 installed pay telephones, 33 installed prison lines and the related equipment, inventory and location agreements.</p>
</text>
